stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> CLOSED
 CLOSED --> OPENING: request and confirmed free space
 OPENING --> OPEN: virtual two seconds
 OPEN --> CLOSING: clear two seconds and close request or dwell
 OPEN --> HOLD: obstruction or invalid evidence
 CLOSING --> HOLD: obstruction or invalid evidence
 HOLD --> CLOSING: clear two seconds
 CLOSING --> CLOSED: virtual two seconds
 OPENING --> FAULT: actuator failure
 CLOSING --> FAULT: actuator failure
 FAULT --> OPEN: reset and stable clear evidence
